OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CToday:FPartly cloudy to start with a   
OL,6,Fpatchy frost and the odd patch of mist 
OL,7,Fand fog. Remaining fine with some      
OL,8,Fsunny spells through the day.          
OL,9,FTemperatures around average. Light     
OL,10,Fwinds.                                 
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine evening with some      
OL,13,Fclear spells. Cloud builds overnight   
OL,14,Fwith some patchy light rain developing 
OL,15,Fby dawn in the west. Milder for most   
OL,16,Fwith freshening winds.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
