OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CSunday:FA cloudy day with light rain   
OL,6,Fin the west and far south at times,    
OL,7,Fclearing westwards later. Temperatures 
OL,8,Fnear average with fresh breeze at      
OL,9,Ftimes.                                 
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPartly
OL,12,Fcloudy with isolated showers on        
OL,13,FMonday. Cloudier through Tuesday with  
OL,14,Fstrengthening winds and rain in the    
OL,15,Fwest. Cloudy, breezy with rain on      
OL,16,FWednesday. Temperatures just below     
OL,17,Faverage.                               
